{"id":"b4l3sj64mw7di2taqeghjk43f","title":"欧文·斯通与维生素C的工业应用","originalTitle":"维生素C应用的推手——Irwin Stone","summary":"欧文·斯通通过40年的研究，将维生素C（VIC）从实验室引入食品工业，成为首个将抗坏血酸作为防腐剂的人。他提出人类对维生素C的需求远超预防坏血病所需的量，认为维生素C是重要的生理和代谢需求。《治愈因子》一书强调了维生素C在多种疾病中的潜在应用价值。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=526326&do=blog&id=1560211"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-08T01:31:36.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-08T06:52:20.329Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-08T06:52:20.329Z","category":"gene-cell","tags":["研究成果","Nature"],"score":33,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"03a38e9b-864a-4b29-b25d-21f95ce48b77","title":"欧文·斯通推动维生素C工业应用及生理需求争议"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"03a38e9b-864a-4b29-b25d-21f95ce48b77","title":"欧文·斯通推动维生素C工业应用及生理需求争议"}],"topics":[{"slug":"nature","name":"Nature"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fw189dknJTPo","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}